1
00:00:00,073 --> 00:00:02,323
(Leonard:)What are you talking about?

2
00:00:02,492 --> 00:00:04,372
SHELDON: Ahem.
PENNY: Oh.

3
00:00:06,204 --> 00:00:07,284
(Sheldon:)Einstein.

4
00:00:08,248 --> 00:00:10,338
Yeah. I'm gonna need a little more.

5
00:00:11,084 --> 00:00:13,714
(Sheldon:)Albert Einstein.

6
00:00:15,631 --> 00:00:17,341
(Leonard:)Keep going.

7
00:00:17,507 --> 00:00:19,967
When Einstein came up
with special relativity...

8
00:00:20,135 --> 00:00:21,965
(Sheldon:)...he was working
at the patent office.

9
00:00:22,137 --> 00:00:24,517
So you're gonna go work
at the patent office?

10
00:00:24,723 --> 00:00:27,353
Oh, don't be absurd.
That's in Washington.

11
00:00:27,517 --> 00:00:30,227
(Sheldon:)I could never live in a city
whose streets are laid out...

12
00:00:30,395 --> 00:00:31,935
(Sheldon:)...in a wheel-and-spoke pattern.

13
00:00:32,105 --> 00:00:35,355
(Sheldon:)No. I'm going to find
a similarly menial job...

14
00:00:35,525 --> 00:00:38,485
(Sheldon:)...where my basal ganglia are occupied
with a routine task...

15
00:00:38,654 --> 00:00:42,534
(Sheldon:)...freeing my prefrontal cortex
to work quietly in the background.

16
00:00:44,034 --> 00:00:45,114
(Leonard:)A great plan.

17
00:00:45,285 --> 00:00:48,125
Of course. Even talking to you
is sufficiently menial.

18
00:00:48,288 --> 00:00:50,828
(Sheldon:)I can feel the proverbial juices
starting to flow.

19
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:54,040
(Raj:)Okay.
Well, thanks for sharing with us.

20
00:00:54,211 --> 00:00:55,841
(Leonard:)-Good night.
-You're welcome.

21
00:00:56,004 --> 00:00:57,424
(Sheldon:)Good night to you too.

22
00:00:57,589 --> 00:00:58,629
[PENNY & LEONARD SIGH]

